     "simpleTitle": "Dirac giver en meget bredere, klarere og strammere lyd",
     "bias": "positive",
     "key": "dirac-results",
     "groupId": "939047fa-fc65-4d70-af0b-da46de656951"
    },
    "reliable compatibility with NAD and Bluesound devices": {
